            "text": "Scoping the assertion to the Exit codes: block prevents incidental mentions elsewhere in help text from satisfying the contract, while deriving expected values from EXIT makes future additions fail closed.",
            "markdown": "Scoping the assertion to the `Exit codes:` block prevents incidental mentions elsewhere in help text from satisfying the contract, while deriving expected values from `EXIT` makes future additions fail closed."
          },
